ove the expanded array, pointing to its left end. However, the 'right' box =
is now orange, and its arrow points to a location within the expanded array=
, suggesting the insertion or addition of elements near the right end.  A d=
otted line connects the orange 'right' box to the newly added elements, vis=
ually highlighting the expansion at the right side of the array.  The expan=
ded array also shows a continuation gap with additional dots, similar to th=
e initial array." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"540" height=3D"54" decoding=3D"=
