"></div></figure>
</li>
<li>
<p>To <strong>shrink</strong> the window is to advance the left pointer:</p=
>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
img alt=3D"Image represents a visual depiction of a 'shrink' operation with=
in a coding pattern context.  The diagram shows two stages. The first stage=
 displays two rectangular boxes labeled 'left' (grey) and 'right' (grey), e=
ach pointing downwards with an arrow to a light-blue, horizontally-elongate=
